  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Putting the Vulnerable First, Furthering the Human Rights Agenda in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To help create a more rights-conscious civil society and state &#x2013; where the needs of the vulnerable, the marginalized and the excluded, are prioritized. Project goal: To develop an independent, evidence-based discourse on human rights and democratic principles that enables ordinary (and especially vulnerable) citizens to recognize and assert their rights.</narrative>
  </description>
